<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-month T-bill auction lowest price at 99.81.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-month T-bill auction lowest price at 99.81.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance said its auction of 1.4 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, on Wednesday produced the following results:</p>
<p> Lowest price     99.810  Stop rate     0.379 pct</p>
<p> Average price    99.812  Average yield 0.375 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	  4.8193 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids     1.3996 trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 74.5934 pct</p>
<p>Issue date  Nov 11, 1996  Maturity    May 12, 1997</p>
